# Get set up for success — global overlay

The **Get set up for success** card is a fixed/sheet overlay for Limited Alpha after Get Started. It must appear on **every admin page**, not only Overview.

## Rule

| Surface | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Any `/admin/*` route (except while All Set blocks) | `SetupSuccessCardHost` may show the card when `shouldShowSetupSuccessCard` |
| Profile setup nav click | Clears dismiss → host shows the card on the **current** page |
| Action item click | Minimize (`dismissSetupSuccessCard`) then navigate — card stays closed until Profile setup |
| Close (X) | `dismissSetupSuccessCard` — Profile setup nav remains until checklist complete |

## Autofix (Bugbot)

If a PR mounts `GetSetUpForSuccessCard` only inside `AdminOverviewDashboard` (or any single page):

1. Move/keep it in `SetupSuccessCardHost` rendered from `AdminLayout`.
2. Do not require navigating to Overview to reopen the card after Profile setup.
3. Keep progress loading via `loadSetupSuccessProgress` + `PROPERTY_DETAILS_CHANGED_EVENTS` so saves on other pages update the card.

## Where it lives

- Host: `src/components/SetupSuccessCardHost.tsx`
- Layout: `src/components/AdminLayout.tsx`
- UI: `src/components/GetSetUpForSuccessCard.tsx`

## Do not

- Render the card only on Overview
- Navigate to `/admin` solely to show the checklist after Profile setup
